# FORCED arms (no shipped DBAR): DestructibleBarriers spawned in 08_sand_casualpirates (42b935e4) with
# area CMDLs as chunk models and area PARTs as chunk-destroy particles. Spawn order = editor ids
# e0036ff00.. (A..N). A: 3x2x5 grid, every model, four particles, five sfx. B: no row/layer/base
# model, starts down (bool prop last: the 4-byte value would misalign any later prop). C: lower delay
# 1 s. D: lower delay 0. E/F: other models (transparency arms). G: 1x1x5 (split-off top). H: no
# center/right/base model (never damaged: a chunk draw would call a null model). I: 3x2x5 that never
# lowers (chunk draws). J..O: 2x1x4 that never lower (split-offs with dead chunks above the split).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/destructiblebarrier.py <out> \
#   42b935e4,08_sand_casualpirates --con tools/drivers/destructiblebarrier_forced.con --fast --frames 4000
@f200 god 1; give missile 50; give chargeBeam 1
@f210 spawn DBAR d 10 model c809d6aa prop cd4f7e71 3 prop 609c6240 2 prop 1eb90d06 0x5d2926fc prop 982d7fa8 0xcdcbdf04 prop 5371ac0d 0x5d2926fc prop 4e749cb5 0xcdcbdf04 prop 6e4a9d27 0x10 prop bc2381a6 0x11 prop 6575a3d5 0x12 prop c91b0946 0x13 prop 4b2d5a37 0x14
@f212 spawn DBAR d 20 model 9a3fc483 prop 396660b4 0xffffffff prop 48e25884 0xffffffff prop f1abb2c7 0xffffffff prop 6575a3d5 0x12 prop c91b0946 0x13 prop 4b2d5a37 0x14 prop 4d3109e3 0x01000000
@f214 spawn DBAR d 30 model 3801de98 prop cd9c67fe 1.0 prop 396660b4 0xffffffff prop 48e25884 0xffffffff
@f216 spawn DBAR d 40 model bfb4a8ee prop cd9c67fe 0.0
@f218 spawn DBAR d 50 model f964d6e0
@f220 spawn DBAR d 60 model d87334fa
@f222 spawn DBAR d 12 model 66f3b2a7 prop cd4f7e71 1 prop 609c6240 1 prop 396660b4 0xffffffff prop 48e25884 0xffffffff
@f224 spawn DBAR d 8 model c809d6aa prop 90f55c5d 0xffffffff prop e1975355 0xffffffff prop f1abb2c7 0xffffffff
@f226 spawn DBAR d 16 model c809d6aa prop cd4f7e71 4 prop 609c6240 2 prop 605847b9 100.0 prop cd9c67fe 0.0
@f228 spawn DBAR 6 d 14 model 9a3fc483 prop a7f551f7 4 prop 605847b9 100.0 prop cd9c67fe 0.0
@f230 objs dbar; orbit e0036ff03
# A: small player hit (no chunk destroyed), beam/charged/missile shots (projectile arm), big hit (lower)
@f240 damage e0036ff00 1
@f250 shoot e0036ff00
@f270 shoot e0036ff00 charged
@f290 shoot e0036ff00 missile
@f330 damage e0036ff00 12
@f360 damage e0036ff00 200
@f362 damage e0036ff00 200
@f366 send e0036ff00 Reset
# B starts down: raise it with the player inside (touch arm), then move it away
@f300 place e0036ff01 player 0
@f302 send e0036ff01 Reset
@f340 place e0036ff01 player 25
# C: a hit, then the 1 s lower delay; D: a hit with delay 0; far barriers: player out of radius
@f380 place e0036ff02 player 6; damage e0036ff02 12
@f382 shoot e0036ff03
@f384 damage e0036ff04 5
@f386 damage e0036ff05 5
# G: split the top off
@f400 damage e0036ff06 12
@f420 damage e0036ff06 30
# H: damage with no damager (hurt), so TakeDamage sees no source actor; I: chunk draws; J..O: split-offs, two hits per tick
@f430 hurt e0036ff07 12
@f432 damage e0036ff08 12
@f434 damage e0036ff08 12
@f440 damage e0036ff09 17; damage e0036ff09 17
@f442 damage e0036ff0a 17; damage e0036ff0a 17
@f444 damage e0036ff0b 12; damage e0036ff0b 22
@f446 damage e0036ff0c 22; damage e0036ff0c 12
@f448 damage e0036ff0d 17; damage e0036ff0d 17
@f450 damage e0036ff0e 27
@f460 damage e0036ff09 12; damage e0036ff0a 12; damage e0036ff0b 12; damage e0036ff0c 12; damage e0036ff0d 12; damage e0036ff0e 12
# A after lowering (state 2): raise it (Reset), lower it again (Reset in state 0), raise it
@f500 send e0036ff00 Reset
@f600 send e0036ff00 Reset
@f700 send e0036ff00 Reset
@f720 send e0036ff02 Reset
# inactive: Think early return, GetTouchBounds/GetAimPosition empty arm
@f800 send e0036ff03 Deactivate
@f802 shoot e0036ff03
@f830 send e0036ff03 Activate
# delete while moving (Delete with a live move emitter)
@f900 send e0036ff00 Reset
@f902 send e0036ff00 Delete
@f904 send e0036ff01 Reset
@f906 send e0036ff01 Delete
@f950 objs dbar
